@startuml cryptoServiceInterface
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

class "Crypto service" as CRYS <<component>> #LightBlue {
  .. provides ..
  +CryptoService_encrypt(data)
  +CryptoService_decrypt(data)
  +CryptoService_verify(data, signature)
  .. requires ..
  -StorageService_readData(key)
}

legend right
  |= Section |= Meaning |
  | provides (+) | Interface offered by the component |
  | requires (-) | Interface the component needs from another component |
endlegend
@enduml
